MVVM pattern for SwiftUI:

Views/ → SwiftUI Views

ViewModels/ → ObservableObject classes

Models/ → Data models

Services/ → Networking, persistence, etc.

Utilities/ → Helpers, extensions

Each file should contain one primary type (struct/class/enum).

Keep SwiftUI views small and composable. Break down large views into subviews.



